      "content": "small steps dont really matter when the destination is just more of the same. it feels less like a challenge to overcome and more like a trap. i look at everything—the money, the expectations, the exhaustion—and there is just no version of the future where this feels better. it's like i'm just waiting for a way to finally just stop the noise.",
